VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT multi-demo
GOAL
  Multiple claims with invariant.
CLAIM a REQUIRED
  ENSURE first holds
CLAIM b REQUIRED
  ENSURE second holds
INVARIANT no-evil CRITICAL
  ENSURE no evil
VERIFY a
  USING test.true
VERIFY b
  USING test.true
VERIFY no-evil
  USING test.true
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
